<title>USA: Jilin to issue up to 300 mln A shrs in China.</title>
<headline>Jilin to issue up to 300 mln A shrs in China.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jilin Chemical Industrial Co Ltd said Monday shareholders authorized the company to issue an additional 300 million A shares to Chinese investors over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>Jilin currently has 3.7 billion shares outstanding. Jilin holds 2.4 billion shares, Chinese investors currently hold 350 million A shares and 965 million H shares trade on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Jilin said the newly issued shares' price should not be less than the company's H shares traded in Hong Kong.</p>
</text>
